name: Erratic Nine Spike — many 9s
author: corpus
description: >-
  Erratic Deck starting deck with at least 13 Nines, a 25% rank spike for Cloud 9,
  Odd Todd, and X-of-a-kind hands. RAG aliases: erratic nines, many 9s, Cloud 9 money,
  nine clump, goofy rank spike.
deck: Erratic
stake: White
must:
  - erraticRank: Nine
    min: 13
should:
  - joker: Cloud9
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 55
  - joker: OddTodd
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: TheTrio
    label: "Three of a Kind payoff from Nine density"
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
  - joker: TheFamily
    label: "Four/Five of a Kind payoff from Nine density"
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
